{"kind":"symbol","relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/HTTPDestinations\/documentation\/HTTPDestinations\/BatchEncoder","doc:\/\/MatomoEncoding\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/MatomoEncoding\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"type":"conformsTo"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/matomoencoding\/matomobatchencoder"]}],"topicSections":[{"title":"Initializers","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/MatomoEncoding\/documentation\/MatomoEncoding\/MatomoBatchEncoder\/init(siteID:dimensions:category:plan:limit:now:)"],"anchor":"Initializers"},{"title":"Instance Methods","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/MatomoEncoding\/documentation\/MatomoEncoding\/MatomoBatchEncoder\/requests(for:)"],"anchor":"Instance-Methods"},{"title":"Type Aliases","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/MatomoEncoding\/documentation\/MatomoEncoding\/MatomoBatchEncoder\/Failure"],"anchor":"Type-Aliases"},{"title":"Type Properties","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/MatomoEncoding\/documentation\/MatomoEncoding\/MatomoBatchEncoder\/batchLimit","doc:\/\/MatomoEncoding\/documentation\/MatomoEncoding\/MatomoBatchEncoder\/transientStatuses"],"anchor":"Type-Properties"},{"title":"Type Methods","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/MatomoEncoding\/documentation\/MatomoEncoding\/MatomoBatchEncoder\/outcome(of:for:)"],"anchor":"Type-Methods"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/MatomoEncoding\/documentation\/MatomoEncoding\/MatomoBatchEncoder","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/MatomoEncoding\/documentation\/MatomoEncoding"]]},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/HTTPDestinations\/documentation\/HTTPDestinations\/BatchEncoder"},{"type":"text","text":" of Matomo’s bulk tracking API, so an "},{"code":"HTTPDestination","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" can"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"send events to a Matomo installation’s "},{"code":"POST \/matomo.php","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MatomoBatchEncoder"}],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"overview","level":2,"text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Make the destination with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/MatomoEncoding\/documentation\/MatomoEncoding\/HTTPDestinations\/HTTPDestination\/matomo(url:siteID:dimensions:category:plan:backoff:clock:now:)"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"which fills in the endpoint, this encoder and its limits:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let matomo = try HTTPDestination.matomo(","    url: url,  \/\/ where Matomo is installed: https:\/\/analytics.example.com","    siteID: 3,  \/\/ the app's site in Matomo","    dimensions: [\"plan\": 1, \"seats\": 2],  \/\/ custom dimensions made in Matomo","    category: \"Shop\",  \/\/ each event's category","    plan: plan)"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The body is a JSON object of content type "},{"code":"application\/json","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"{\"requests\":[…]}","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", whose"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"requests","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" are one tracking request per record, oldest first, as Matomo asks for them: each a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"string, "},{"code":"?","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and the request’s query, every value percent-encoded but for RFC 3986’s unreserved"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"characters. Each request is a Matomo event, with these parameters in this order:"}]},{"header":"row","type":"table","rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Parameter","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Holds"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"idsite"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The site ID the encoder is made with","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"rec"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"1"},{"type":"text","text":", without which Matomo records nothing"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"apiv"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"1","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", the Tracking API’s version","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"_id","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The visitor: the last 64 bits of the record’s session, its "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SessionKey"},{"type":"text","text":", as 16 lowercase hexadecimal digits; of the record’s own "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"EventRecord\/id"},{"type":"text","text":" the same way when its context has no session"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"cdt"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When the event was tracked, in whole seconds since 1970, rounded down"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"ca","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"1"},{"type":"text","text":": the request is an event, not a page view, should Matomo’s Events plugin be turned off"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"e_c"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The category the encoder is made with"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"e_a","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The event’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Event\/name"},{"type":"text","text":", as it is"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"lang"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The record’s locale’s BCP 47 identifier, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"en-US"},{"type":"text","text":", when its context has a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"LocaleKey"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"dimension<ID>","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Each mapped property’s value, by the dimension’s ID, from lowest to highest","type":"text"}]}]]]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The session is the only identifier sent. Matomo counts a visitor per "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"_id"},{"type":"text","text":", so its visitors are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sessions, each a new visitor of one visit. A record with no session (one tracked by a tracker"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"without "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Enricher.sessions()"},{"type":"text","text":") is its own visitor, linked to nothing. A record a store recovers"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"after a relaunch keeps its session, so it goes out under the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"_id"},{"type":"text","text":" of its first send. No "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"uid"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"cid"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"token_auth"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"cip"},{"type":"text","text":" or device"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"identifier is sent, and nothing of the record’s context but its locale, nor its trace context."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A property reaches Matomo only as the custom dimension "},{"code":"dimensions","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" maps it to, read through"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the event’s schema in "},{"code":"plan","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", as "},{"code":"PropertyReader","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" reads it: a string as it is, a number as JSON"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"writes it, a Boolean as "},{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"code":"false","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", and an array or object as its JSON. A "},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is left"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"out. A "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Sensitive"},{"type":"text","text":" value is never sent, whatever the record reveals: the property is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"left out, and an element of an array is "},{"code":"null","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". Every other property is left out, and the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"encoder logs a notice once, when it is made, for each event of the plan with properties no"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"dimension is mapped to ("},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/MatomoEncoding\/documentation\/MatomoEncoding\/MatomoDimensions\/unmappedProperties(in:)"},{"type":"text","text":")."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A record the encoder can’t write, or that Matomo would refuse or store other than it is, is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"left out of the request, and the batch’s other records are sent: one whose event and version","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"plan"},{"text":" doesn’t describe, one whose event name Matomo would empty or cut short, one whose event","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"isn’t ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Encodable"},{"text":", one that holds a value JSON can’t, one whose timestamp has no whole seconds","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"of ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Int64"},{"text":" or is more than 23 hours before or after the batch is encoded, one with a dimension’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"value longer than Matomo keeps, and one whose request is over 1,000,000 bytes","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/MatomoEncoding\/documentation\/MatomoEncoding\/MatomoEncodingError","isActive":true},{"text":"). ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/MatomoEncoding\/documentation\/MatomoEncoding\/MatomoBatchEncoder\/requests(for:)","isActive":true},{"text":" returns them as ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SkippedRecord"},{"text":"s, which","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"HTTPDestination"},{"text":" logs and reports on its ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"dropReports"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Each request’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"EncodedRequest\/deadline"},{"text":" is 23 hours after its oldest record was tracked, so","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"HTTPDestination"},{"text":" drops a request still being retried by then, every record of it, the younger","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"ones included, and reports it as ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"HTTPDropReport.deadlineExceeded(deadline:recordIDs:)"},{"text":", rather","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"than send it to a Matomo that would answer 200 and store nothing.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/MatomoEncoding\/documentation\/MatomoEncoding\/MatomoBatchEncoder\/requests(for:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" splits a batch into requests within the encoder’s limit, "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/MatomoEncoding\/documentation\/MatomoEncoding\/MatomoBatchEncoder\/batchLimit","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"default, and makes none for a batch with no record it can write, so "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"HTTPDestination"},{"type":"text","text":" sends"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"nothing for it. Matomo answers 200 to a bulk request it reads, counting the tracking requests"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it refuses as "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"invalid"},{"type":"text","text":" in its answer without storing them; 400 to a body it can’t read, which"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"HTTPDestination"},{"type":"text","text":" drops and reports with every record of the request; and 500 when its database"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"fails, which "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"HTTPDestination"},{"type":"text","text":" retries. A 200 that says Matomo tracked none of the request’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tracking requests is rejected ("},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/MatomoEncoding\/documentation\/MatomoEncoding\/MatomoBatchEncoder\/outcome(of:for:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"), so "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"HTTPDestination"},{"type":"text","text":" drops and reports it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"too; one that refused only some isn’t, as its answer doesn’t say which. It doesn’t remove duplicates, so a record sent again is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"counted again. The bytes are the same for the same records, time and configuration on every run"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and platform."}]}]}],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Structure","title":"MatomoBatchEncoder","symbolKind":"struct","modules":[{"name":"MatomoEncoding"}],"externalID":"s:14MatomoEncoding0A12BatchEncoderV","remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/MatomoEncoding\/MatomoBatchEncoder.swift#L82","fileName":"MatomoBatchEncoder.swift"},"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MatomoBatchEncoder"}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MatomoBatchEncoder"}]},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"references":{"doc://HTTPDestinations/documentation/HTTPDestinations/BatchEncoder":{"title":"BatchEncoder","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"BatchEncoder"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"BatchEncoder"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"What turns a batch of records into the requests "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/HTTPDestinations\/documentation\/HTTPDestinations\/HTTPDestination","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" sends."}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/httpdestinations\/batchencoder","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/HTTPDestinations\/documentation\/HTTPDestinations\/BatchEncoder"},"doc://MatomoEncoding/documentation/MatomoEncoding/MatomoDimensions/unmappedProperties(in:)":{"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/matomoencoding\/matomodimensions\/unmappedproperties(in:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/MatomoEncoding\/documentation\/MatomoEncoding\/MatomoDimensions\/unmappedProperties(in:)","role":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"unmappedProperties"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"in"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:13TrackingPlans0